Here we go! Day 1 of the 2026 American National is officially underway!

@stevengomezjj secures the submission victory and advances to the Featherweight semifinals. 🔥

Watch all the action live on @flograppling and stay tuned for more updates throughout the tournament!

Urijah Faber has not long been retired from MMA, but the competitive drive means he can't stay off the mats for long. He'll be taking on the young phenom Nicky Ryan in our main event at Polaris 10, held on Saturday 25 May in the Poole Lighthouse in the UK, and streamed live & exclusive on UFC Fight Pass


We also have: 
- Craig Jones defending his middleweight belt against Matheus Lutes

- Miha Perhavec looking to make his mark with a high profile match against the tough and dynamic Boogeyman

- Ethan Crelinsten and Ash Williams throwing down for the first ever lightweight belt

- The debut of Nick Rodriguez, against the unflappable Ash Amos

- Japanese MMA legend Caol Uno taking on British MMA pioneer Leigh Remedios

- And a stacked preliminary card!


For anyone in the southern part of the UK, this will be your last chance to watch Polaris live and in person as we'll be moving the show up North and around the country afterwards. So if you're in London or below, make sure you take this chance to come and watch the best grapplers in the world LIVE on the Polaris stage.

Don't forget if you're in the USA you can also place bets on the outcome of all main card matches on Polaris 10 thanks to MyBookie!

